			<item>
				<title>Discover Budapest</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/sightseeing/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you have time to explore Budapest while you’re here for our wedding, these favourite sights are a wonderful place to start:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;attraction-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/parliament.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The Hungarian Parliament reflected in the Danube&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.parlament.hu/en/web/visitors&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Hungarian Parliament Building&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A striking Gothic Revival landmark on the banks of the Danube.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/fishermans-bastion-pinterest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion overlooking the Danube and Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Buda Castle &amp;amp; Fisherman&amp;#39;s Bastion&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Climb Castle Hill for sweeping views across the city.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szechenyi-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The outdoor pools at Széchenyi Thermal Bath&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.szechenyibath.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Széchenyi Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Unwind in Budapest&amp;#39;s famous thermal waters before the celebration.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/veli-bej-budapestinfo.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Interior of Veli Bej Thermal Bath in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.irgalmasrend.hu/site/velibej/home&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Veli Bej Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Step into a restored 16th-century Ottoman bath in the historic Császár complex.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/rudas-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Rudas Baths and Gellért Hill in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.rudasfurdo.hu/en/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Rudas Thermal Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Discover a historic Ottoman bath known for its domed pool and Danube views.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szimpla-kert.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The colorful courtyard and interior of Szimpla Kert&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://szimpla.eu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Szimpla Kert Ruin Bar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Explore Budapest&amp;#39;s iconic ruin bar, known for its eclectic rooms, courtyard and lively atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/grandio-jungle-bar.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Garden courtyard at Grandio Jungle Grill Bar&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://pubcrawlbudapest.hu/ruin-bars/grandio.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Grandio Ruin Bar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;A leafy courtyard bar with relaxed garden seating, food and evening music.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/hungarian-national-museum.png&#34; alt=&#34;Aerial view of the Hungarian National Museum&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Hungarian National Museum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Discover Hungarian history and culture in a landmark neoclassical museum.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/museum-of-fine-arts.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;The neoclassical Museum of Fine Arts in Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mfab.hu/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Museum of Fine Arts Budapest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;See European and Hungarian masterpieces beside Heroes&amp;#39; Square.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Gifts</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/gifts/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/gifts/</guid>
				<description>&lt;section class=&#34;contact-section&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Your presence at our wedding is already a gift. Since we don’t live in Budapest, transporting gifts could get complicated. We’ll gratefully accept a contribution to the costs of the venue.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;a class=&#34;paypal-link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/clapton79&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/paypal.svg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;@clapton79&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
