				<link>http://localhost:1313/photo-credits/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/photo-credits/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;We are grateful to the photographers and sources whose images help us share Budapest with our guests.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian Parliament Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Photo by Pierre Blaché, dedicated to the public domain under CC0. &lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hungarian_Parliament_Building_2023-9.jpg&#34;&gt;View the image and details on Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fisherman&amp;rsquo;s Bastion:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the Pinterest pin supplied for this site. &lt;a href=&#34;https://ph.pinterest.com/pin/641059328208145770/&#34;&gt;View the pin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Széchenyi Thermal Bath:&lt;/strong&gt; Photo by Slyronit, licensed under &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-SA 4.0&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sz%C3%A9chenyi_thermal_bath,_Budapest.jpg&#34;&gt;View the image on Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veli Bej:&lt;/strong&gt; Image via BudapestInfo. &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.budapestinfo.hu/storage/og-images/NbZtAOtS7Gf5a3A61nhBOTjgYRVIHIPq6fsZJ9KV.jpg&#34;&gt;View the source image&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rudas Baths:&lt;/strong&gt; Photo by Globetrotter19, licensed under &lt;a href=&#34;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/&#34;&gt;CC BY-SA 3.0&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rudas_Baths_central_part_and_Gellert_Hill_in_Tab%C3%A1n,_2016_Budapest.jpg&#34;&gt;View the image on Wikimedia Commons&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Szimpla Kert:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://image.stern.de/33776650/t/kY/v2/w1440/r1.7778/-/budapest-szimpla-kert.jpg&#34;&gt;Stern&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grandio Jungle Grill Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nomadicmick.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Ruin-Bars-Budapest-Grandio-Jungle-Grill-Bar-Hostel.jpg&#34;&gt;Nomadic Mick&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian National Museum:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the museum ticket site; &lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Museum of Fine Arts Budapest:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.knykk.hu/hirek/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ahol-a-mult-talalkozik-a-jovovel-uj-kiallitasok-a-2048x1155.jpg&#34;&gt;KNYKK&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.mfab.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Szimpla Kert:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://image.stern.de/33776650/t/kY/v2/w1440/r1.7778/-/budapest-szimpla-kert.jpg&#34;&gt;Stern&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grandio Jungle Grill Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nomadicmick.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Ruin-Bars-Budapest-Grandio-Jungle-Grill-Bar-Hostel.jpg&#34;&gt;Nomadic Mick&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungarian National Museum:&lt;/strong&gt; Image from the ticket site; &lt;a href=&#34;https://mnm.hu/&#34;&gt;official museum website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Museum of Fine Arts:&lt;/strong&gt; Image provided via &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.knykk.hu/hirek/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ahol-a-mult-talalkozik-a-jovovel-uj-kiallitasok-a-2048x1155.jpg&#34;&gt;KNYKK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
